<%- include('partials/header') %>

<h1>Accessible MFA demo</h1>

<p>
  This is a demonstration of passkey sign-in built to be usable with a screen
  reader and a keyboard alone. There is no password, no CAPTCHA, no QR code to
  photograph and no image to compare.
</p>

<h2>How signing in works here</h2>
<ol>
  <li>Your device stores a passkey. The private key never leaves it.</li>
  <li>
    When you sign in, this site asks your device to prove it holds that key.
  </li>
  <li>
    Your device only agrees after it has checked it is you — a fingerprint, a
    face or a device PIN. That check is the second factor.
  </li>
</ol>

<% if (currentUser) { %>
  <p>You are signed in as <strong><%= currentUser.username %></strong>.</p>
  <p><a href="/account">Go to your account</a></p>
<% } else { %>
  <p><a href="/register">Create an account</a> or <a href="/signin">sign in</a>.</p>
<% } %>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
